BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 710.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/categories  |  Public) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 697.0 Tm (- Returns available report categories and icons. The IDs are used by report submission.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 679.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/areas  |  Public) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 666.0 Tm (- Returns area IDs and names. A report is assigned an area only if its location falls inside a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 654.0 Tm (  configured area boundary.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 633.0 Tm (REPORT CREATION AND DISCOVERY) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 612.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/reports  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 599.0 Tm (- Send multipart form fields: category_id, lat, lon, photo \(JPEG or PNG required\), and optional) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 587.0 Tm (  description \(maximum 500 characters\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 571.0 Tm (- The API validates the category, coordinates and actual image signature; stores the photo; saves) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 559.0 Tm (  the report as reported; and records its first status event.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 543.0 Tm (- After saving, it queues optional AI processing. The resident gets the saved report without) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 531.0 Tm (  waiting for AI. Queue failure does not undo the report.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 513.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/reports  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 500.0 Tm (- Returns a paginated list, newest first. Filters: bbox, category_id, area_id, status, mine=true,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 488.0 Tm (  following=true, include_duplicates=true.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 472.0 Tm (- Merged duplicates are hidden by default and represented by their parent case. Page size defaults) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 460.0 Tm (  to 50 and is capped at 200.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 442.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/reports/{id}  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 429.0 Tm (- Returns one report: category, status, coordinates, photo URL, creator/assignee IDs, due date,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 417.0 Tm (  duplicate count/link, AI suggestion if present, and current user's following flag.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 399.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/reports/{id}/follow  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 386.0 Tm (- Follows the report so the user can receive its updates. Safe to repeat; returns 204.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 368.0 Tm (DELETE /api/v1/reports/{id}/follow  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 355.0 Tm (- Stops following the report. Safe when already unfollowed; returns 204.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 337.0 Tm (GET /uploads/{path}  |  Public; outside /api/v1) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 324.0 Tm (- Serves a saved report photo. Report responses provide the photo_url used to request it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 308.0 Tm (- Coordinates in API responses use {lat, lon}; PostGIS storage writes points as longitude then) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 296.0 Tm (  latitude.) Tj ET
