BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 731.0 Tm (REPORT WORKFLOW) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 712.0 Tm (Normal path: reported -> verified -> assigned -> in_progress -> resolved. A verifier or admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 700.0 Tm (can reject a reported case instead. Rejected and resolved are final states.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 681.0 Tm (PATCH /api/v1/reports/{id}/status  |  Verifier, authority, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 668.0 Tm (- JSON input: {status, note?}. Verifier/admin can verify or reject; rejecting requires a reason.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 652.0 Tm (- Only the assigned authority or an admin can move assigned -> in_progress -> resolved. Use the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 640.0 Tm (  assign endpoint to enter assigned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 624.0 Tm (- Each accepted change updates the report and adds a status-history event; interested users are) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 612.0 Tm (  notified in the same transaction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 596.0 Tm (- Invalid transition returns 409. A merged duplicate cannot be changed directly; update its parent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 584.0 Tm (  case.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 566.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/reports/{id}/assign  |  Verifier, authority, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 553.0 Tm (- JSON input: {assignee_id, due_date?}. The selected user must have the authority role; due_date) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 541.0 Tm (  must be YYYY-MM-DD and not in the past.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 525.0 Tm (- Assigning a verified report moves it to assigned and records the assignee/due date. An assigned) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 513.0 Tm (  but not started report can be reassigned; in-progress work cannot.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 497.0 Tm (- Assignment is part of the workflow: it records an event and creates notifications for the new) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 485.0 Tm (  assignee and, when reassigned, the former assignee.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 467.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/reports/{id}/history  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 454.0 Tm (- Returns status events in time order, including who changed the status and any note. Used as the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 442.0 Tm (  case audit trail and to calculate resolution time.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 421.0 Tm (WHO CAN CHANGE STATUS?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 402.0 Tm (- reported -> verified or rejected: verifier/admin.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 386.0 Tm (- verified -> assigned: verifier/authority/admin, through POST /assign.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 370.0 Tm (- assigned -> in_progress -> resolved: assigned authority or admin.) Tj ET
