BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 731.0 Tm (DUPLICATE REVIEW) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 712.0 Tm (AI produces suggestions; a human verifier/admin decides whether reports are actually the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 700.0 Tm (case. A merge does not delete the child report.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 681.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/reports/{id}/duplicates  |  Verifier, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 668.0 Tm (- Returns saved candidate matches, highest score first, with reasons. Suggestions only exist after) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 656.0 Tm (  the duplicate AI hook has run successfully.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 638.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/reports/{id}/merge  |  Verifier, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 625.0 Tm (- JSON input: {parent_id}. The path ID is the duplicate; parent_id is the main report to keep as) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 613.0 Tm (  the case.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 597.0 Tm (- Only reported/verified children can be merged, and the parent must still be open. Followers and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 585.0 Tm (  the child's author follow the parent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 569.0 Tm (- Updates duplicate links and parent report_count, writes an audit note, and alerts the child) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 557.0 Tm (  author. Default report lists then omit the child.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 539.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/reports/{id}/unmerge  |  Verifier, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 526.0 Tm (- Restores a merged report as its own case, clears the duplicate link, adjusts the parent's count) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 514.0 Tm (  and records an audit note.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 493.0 Tm (BACKGROUND AI AND JOB QUEUE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 474.0 Tm (- After report creation: API saves the report -> enqueues process_new_report -> worker can) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 462.0 Tm (  classify the photo and find nearby duplicate candidates -> results are saved for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 450.0 Tm (  report/staff review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 434.0 Tm (- AI hooks are optional configuration. If not configured, classification and duplicate suggestions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 422.0 Tm (  are skipped; an AI category is not guaranteed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 406.0 Tm (- Duplicate matching considers eligible older, open, unmerged nearby reports. Hotspot refresh may) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 394.0 Tm (  also run in the background.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 378.0 Tm (- GET /api/v1/health exposes queue status. A growing pending count with no workers points to a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 366.0 Tm (  worker/Redis issue, not a failed report save.) Tj ET
