BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 731.0 Tm (NOTIFICATIONS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 712.0 Tm (The backend creates messages when relevant report actions happen. A user is not notified about) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 700.0 Tm (their own action. Notifications are scoped to the signed-in user.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 681.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/notifications  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 668.0 Tm (- Returns the current user's notifications, newest first. Optional filters: unread=true, page,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 656.0 Tm (  per_page.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 638.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/notifications/unread-count  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 625.0 Tm (- Returns {count}; intended for the app's unread badge.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 607.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 594.0 Tm (- Marks one of the current user's notifications read. A notification owned by someone else is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 582.0 Tm (  treated as not found.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 564.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/notifications/read-all  |  Signed-in user) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 551.0 Tm (- Marks all of the current user's notifications read.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 535.0 Tm (- Status changes notify the report author/followers; assignment notifies the assignee;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 523.0 Tm (  reassignment also notifies the former assignee; merge notifies the child author.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 502.0 Tm (STAFF ANALYTICS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 483.0 Tm (All analytics routes below require authority or admin. Counts generally represent cases, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 471.0 Tm (merged duplicate children are not counted twice. Trends count every submission, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 459.0 Tm (duplicates.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 440.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/analytics/summary  |  Authority, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 427.0 Tm (- Dashboard totals, open/resolved counts, hotspot count, category/status breakdowns, open cases by) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 415.0 Tm (  area, and average days to resolve. Optional area_id.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 397.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/analytics/categories  |  Authority, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 384.0 Tm (- Case count for each category, including zero counts. Optional area_id.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 366.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/analytics/statuses  |  Authority, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 353.0 Tm (- Case count by status for statuses that currently have cases. Optional area_id.) Tj ET
