BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 731.0 Tm (ANALYTICS, HOTSPOTS AND SERVICE STATUS) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 710.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/analytics/trends  |  Authority, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 697.0 Tm (- Daily report submissions in UTC, with zero-count days included. days defaults to 30 and must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 685.0 Tm (  between 1 and 365. Duplicate submissions are included.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 667.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/analytics/hotspots  |  Authority, admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 654.0 Tm (- Returns saved geographic clusters, largest first: center, radius, report count, most common) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 642.0 Tm (  category and computation time.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 624.0 Tm (POST /api/v1/analytics/hotspots/recompute  |  Admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 611.0 Tm (- Rebuilds clusters on demand. Optional JSON: {eps_m, min_samples}; defaults are 250 metres and 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 599.0 Tm (  reports. Background report processing may refresh them automatically too.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 581.0 Tm (GET /api/v1/health  |  Public) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 568.0 Tm (- Checks API/database/PostGIS and reports queue mode/health where available. Useful for diagnosing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 556.0 Tm (  backend or worker status.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 535.0 Tm (HOW THE PIECES CONNECT) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 516.0 Tm (- Auth identifies the caller and role. Reports use that identity as creator and gate staff actions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 504.0 Tm (  by role.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 488.0 Tm (- Report status changes write status_events and trigger notifications; the history endpoint reads) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 476.0 Tm (  that audit trail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 460.0 Tm (- Follow records decide who receives report updates. Merging moves the child audience to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 448.0 Tm (  parent case.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 432.0 Tm (- The worker enriches reports asynchronously with optional AI outputs and may refresh hotspots.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 420.0 Tm (  Staff analytics read persisted reports/events/hotspots.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 399.0 Tm (API CONVENTIONS AND ACCURACY NOTES) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 380.0 Tm (- Base path is /api/v1 except photo delivery at /uploads/{path}. Protected routes require a bearer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 368.0 Tm (  token.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 352.0 Tm (- Errors follow {error: {code, message, details}}. Typical meanings: 401 unauthenticated, 403) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 340.0 Tm (  forbidden, 404 missing, 409 conflicting state, 422 invalid input.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 324.0 Tm (- Four role types are defined; the number of actual user accounts is database data. GET /users) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 312.0 Tm (  returns a page, not a total count.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 296.0 Tm (- PATCH /api/v1/users/{id}/role is documented in OpenAPI but is not registered in the running) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 284.0 Tm (  Flask app. Do not present it as available.) Tj ET
